.pytest_cache/

# Raw run output. Regenerable, grows per run, and git is not a data store. The
# directory is durable (unlike the harness scratchpad), so records survive a
# reboot without entering history. A run that EVIDENCES a claim in the docs gets
# rendered to a readable transcript and that transcript is committed - not the blob.
eval/records/

# Launchers are INPUTS, not run output - they live in eval/runs/ and are tracked.
# A run recipe that is not versioned cannot be reviewed after it misfires.
